 keycard sandbox   setup · step 6 of 6

  Zone policy
  A zone uses one set of access rules, called a policy set, at a time. The
  sandbox needs its own set turned on, so that the agent can work for the
  user.

  Replace it with "sandbox" when the sandbox runs?
  The zone's active policy set is "default". Only one set can be active. Its
  policies will stop applying to everyone in the zone.
  ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  │   Yes                                                                    │
  │ ▸ No                                                                     │
  ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  y or n answers it.






